/**
 * Unit tests for the Layer 1 post-hoc recovery routine (recovery.ts).
 *
 * Tests use vi.mock to intercept fs and child_process calls.
 * The recovery routine must:
 *   - be a no-op when a valid in_review result.json exists
 *   - commit dirty working tree when present
